# Raw per-model bench summaries carry session-derived fragment TEXT (the model's extraction of
# the operator's session) — reproducible by re-running the bench, never committed. Only the folded
# reports (metrics + scores, no session content) and the execution registers are tracked.
*.json
!rung1-report.json
!execution_register.json
!rung2-report.json
!rung2_execution_register.json
